<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttx="urn:ttml:extensions:shared-ruby:1"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="拝啓、100年後の私に。"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="森羅万象"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="あよ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Compilation CD-BOOK 東方万葉集"/><amll:meta key="album" value="シンラミュージアム2号館"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1413789368"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1918892791"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000kKW8T2lbiqU"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1612382792"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Mrs4s"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="12137562"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Mrs4s"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:51.384"><div begin="00:25.220" end="04:25.580"><p begin="00:25.220" end="00:34.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:25.220" end="00:26.080" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="ゆ|み|は|り" ttx:rubyTimes="00:25.220,00:25.700 00:25.700,00:26.080 00:26.080,00:26.520 00:26.520,00:26.940">弦</span><span begin="00:26.080" end="00:26.940" ttx:rubyGroup="1">月</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">昇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.940" end="00:27.580">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.580" end="00:27.840">ぼ</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.840" end="00:28.620">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.620" end="00:28.980">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.980" end="00:29.480">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.480" end="00:30.040">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:30.040" end="00:30.340">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:30.340" end="00:30.880">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">筆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:31.160" end="00:31.560">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:31.560" end="00:32.020">で</span></span></span><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:32.420">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">取</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:32.420" end="00:32.840">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:32.840" end="00:34.160">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">弓月升 丑一时 取笔蘸墨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yumihari noboru ushi hitotsu fude o toru</span></p><p begin="00:35.340" end="00:44.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.820">し</span><span begin="00:35.820" end="00:36.220">た</span><span begin="00:36.220" end="00:36.620">た</span><span begin="00:36.620" end="00:37.020">め</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.660">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.660" end="00:37.960">む</span></span></span><span begin="00:37.960" end="00:38.560">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幻</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.720" end="00:38.960">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.960" end="00:39.520">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:39.520" end="00:40.120">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.120" end="00:40.420">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:40.420" end="00:41.020">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.640">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.640" end="00:42.060">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.740" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="か|け|ら" ttx:rubyTimes="00:42.060,00:42.740 00:42.740,00:42.940 00:42.940,00:44.340">欠</span><span begin="00:42.740" end="00:44.340" ttx:rubyGroup="1">片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">以备编撰 幻想一章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shitatame tsumugu gensō no hitokakera</span></p><p begin="00:45.480" end="00:54.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:45.480" end="00:45.930">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:45.930" end="00:46.320">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:46.320" end="00:46.760">さ</span><span begin="00:46.760" end="00:47.180">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">窓</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.180" end="00:47.780">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.780" end="00:48.160">ど</span></span></span><span begin="00:48.160" end="00:48.540">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.040">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:49.040" end="00:49.280">ぞ</span></span></span><span begin="00:49.280" end="00:49.700">け</span><span begin="00:49.700" end="00:50.320">ば</span><span begin="00:50.320" end="00:50.540">ほ</span><span begin="00:50.540" end="00:51.120">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.420" end="00:51.860">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.260">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:52.260" end="00:52.640">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:52.640" end="00:53.080">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:53.080" end="00:54.380">か</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">凭虚窗 望林亭 银装素裹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisana mado o nozokeba hora yuki no naka</span></p><p begin="00:55.120" end="01:04.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:55.120" end="00:55.560">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:55.560" end="00:55.760">お</span></span></span><span begin="00:55.760" end="00:55.980">き</span><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.360">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">翔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:56.580" end="00:56.840">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.240">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">跳</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:57.240" end="00:57.880">は</span></span></span><span begin="00:57.880" end="00:58.120">ね</span><span begin="00:58.120" end="00:58.640">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">妖</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.140">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:59.140" end="00:59.300">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">精</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:59.300" end="00:59.820">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:59.820" end="01:00.220">い</span></span></span><span begin="01:00.220" end="01:00.440">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:00.440" end="01:00.700">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:00.700" end="01:01.140">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">木</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:01.480" end="01:01.900">こ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">霊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:01.900" end="01:02.360">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:02.360" end="01:02.960">ま</span></span></span><span begin="01:02.960" end="01:03.280">す</span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:04.500">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">妖精之声 余音袅袅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ōkiku tobihanete yōsei no koe kodama suru</span></p><p begin="01:05.500" end="01:08.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:05.500" end="01:05.720">ま</span><span begin="01:05.720" end="01:05.900">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:05.900" end="01:06.180">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:06.180" end="01:06.320">に</span></span></span><span begin="01:06.320" end="01:06.580">か</span><span begin="01:06.740" end="01:07.320" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="い|た|ず|ら" ttx:rubyTimes="01:06.740,01:06.960 01:06.960,01:07.320 01:07.320,01:07.560 01:07.560,01:07.780">悪</span><span begin="01:07.320" end="01:07.780" ttx:rubyGroup="1">戯</span><span begin="01:07.780" end="01:07.940">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.940" end="01:08.180">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.180" end="01:08.380">か</span></span></span><span begin="01:08.380" end="01:08.620">け</span><span begin="01:08.620" end="01:08.980">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">它们又要做什么恶作剧了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mata nanika itazura o shikakete</span></p><p begin="01:10.400" end="01:13.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">翅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:10.400" end="01:10.620">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:10.620" end="01:10.820">ね</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:10.820" end="01:11.060">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="01:11.060" end="01:11.240">ら</span><span begin="01:11.240" end="01:11.520">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">庭</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:11.680" end="01:11.900">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:11.900" end="01:12.320">わ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:12.320" end="01:12.540">か</span></span></span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:12.760">け</span><span begin="01:12.760" end="01:12.940">て</span><span begin="01:12.940" end="01:13.180">は</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:13.180" end="01:13.380">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:13.380" end="01:13.620">ら</span></span></span><span begin="01:13.620" end="01:13.960">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">摇动着翅膀在庭院追逐嬉戏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hane yurashi niwa kakete wa warau</span></p><p begin="01:14.760" end="01:22.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:14.760" end="01:15.200">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:15.200" end="01:15.640">お</span></span></span><span begin="01:15.640" end="01:16.320">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:16.320" end="01:16.620">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:16.620" end="01:17.000">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:17.000" end="01:17.500">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">浮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:17.760" end="01:18.000">う</span></span></span><span begin="01:18.000" end="01:18.280">か</span><span begin="01:18.280" end="01:18.500">ん</span><span begin="01:18.500" end="01:19.379">でっ</span><span begin="01:19.379" end="01:22.420">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">脑海里浮现出了旧时的记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōi kioku ukandetta</span></p><p begin="01:27.240" end="01:33.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:27.240" end="01:27.680">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:27.680" end="01:28.120">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:28.120" end="01:28.520">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:28.520" end="01:29.320">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:29.320" end="01:29.600">し</span></span></span><span begin="01:29.600" end="01:29.820">ら</span><span begin="01:29.820" end="01:30.160">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:30.160" end="01:30.600">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:30.600" end="01:30.980">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:30.980" end="01:31.440">お</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:31.800" end="01:32.040">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.040" end="01:32.300">ぼ</span></span></span><span begin="01:32.300" end="01:32.680">え</span><span begin="01:32.680" end="01:33.100">て</span><span begin="01:33.100" end="01:33.620">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你那素未谋面的笑容 我依稀记得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no mishiranu egao oboeteru</span></p><p begin="01:33.620" end="01:37.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">深</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:33.620" end="01:34.300">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:34.300" end="01:34.740">か</span></span></span><span begin="01:34.740" end="01:35.140">ま</span><span begin="01:35.140" end="01:35.540">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:35.540" end="01:35.940">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:35.940" end="01:36.360">げ</span></span></span><span begin="01:36.360" end="01:36.940">の</span><span begin="01:36.940" end="01:37.220">よ</span><span begin="01:37.220" end="01:37.980">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">宛若遂远的影像一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fukamaru kage no yō</span></p><p begin="01:38.340" end="01:47.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.340" end="01:38.780">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.780" end="01:39.180">こ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.360" end="01:39.620">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.620" end="01:40.060">ま</span></span></span><span begin="01:40.400" end="01:40.620">い</span><span begin="01:40.620" end="01:40.820">つ</span><span begin="01:40.820" end="01:41.221">か</span><span begin="01:41.221" end="01:41.617">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.617" end="01:42.060">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="01:42.060" end="01:42.641">の『</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:42.860" end="01:43.300">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:43.300" end="01:43.640">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:43.640" end="01:44.099">し</span></span></span><span begin="01:44.099" end="01:44.500">』が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:44.500" end="01:45.380">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:45.380" end="01:45.840">て</span><span begin="01:45.840" end="01:47.520">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">过去 现在 亦或是将来 『我』也都会守护着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kako ima itsuka no hi no watashi ga miteru</span></p><p begin="02:05.020" end="02:13.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="02:05.020" end="02:05.920" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="し|の|の|め" ttx:rubyTimes="02:05.020,02:05.540 02:05.540,02:05.920 02:05.920,02:06.380 02:06.380,02:06.760">東</span><span begin="02:05.920" end="02:06.760" ttx:rubyGroup="1">雲</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">浮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:06.760" end="02:07.340">う</span></span></span><span begin="02:07.340" end="02:07.600">か</span><span begin="02:07.600" end="02:08.120">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">午</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:08.400" end="02:08.620">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:08.620" end="02:08.820">ま</span></span></span><span begin="02:08.820" end="02:09.260">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:09.260" end="02:09.680">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:09.680" end="02:10.080">と</span></span></span><span begin="02:10.080" end="02:10.680">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">目</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:10.920" end="02:11.300">め</span></span></span><span begin="02:11.300" end="02:11.700">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">醒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.700" end="02:12.320">さ</span></span></span><span begin="02:12.320" end="02:12.500">ま</span><span begin="02:12.500" end="02:13.880">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">拂晓至 正午时 睡眼惺忪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinonome ukabu uma no moto ni me o samashi</span></p><p begin="02:14.580" end="02:23.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">騒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:14.580" end="02:15.080">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:15.080" end="02:15.240">わ</span></span></span><span begin="02:15.240" end="02:15.400">が</span><span begin="02:15.400" end="02:15.660">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:15.660" end="02:15.880">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:15.880" end="02:16.040">げ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">庭</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:16.040" end="02:16.280">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:16.280" end="02:16.720">わ</span></span></span><span begin="02:16.720" end="02:17.160">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:17.340" end="02:17.580">な</span></span></span><span begin="02:17.580" end="02:18.020">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:18.380" end="02:18.580">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:18.580" end="02:18.820">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">溶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:18.820" end="02:19.220">と</span></span></span><span begin="02:19.220" end="02:19.560">か</span><span begin="02:19.560" end="02:19.820">し</span><span begin="02:19.820" end="02:19.980">て</span><span begin="02:19.980" end="02:20.520">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雨</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:20.820" end="02:21.260">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:21.260" end="02:21.680">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">模</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:21.680" end="02:22.260">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">様</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:22.260" end="02:22.500">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:22.500" end="02:23.800">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">喧哗的身影早已消失无踪 冰雪消融 细雨绵绵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sawagasu kage niwa ni naku yuki tokashiteku amemoyō</span></p><p begin="02:24.640" end="02:28.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">踏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:24.640" end="02:24.840">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="02:24.840" end="02:25.060">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.060" end="02:25.240">だ</span></span></span><span begin="02:25.240" end="02:25.480">し</span><span begin="02:25.480" end="02:25.860">た</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雨</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.860" end="02:26.120">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:26.120" end="02:26.440">め</span></span></span><span begin="02:26.440" end="02:26.680">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:26.680" end="02:26.900">き</span></span></span><span begin="02:26.900" end="02:27.080">に</span><span begin="02:27.080" end="02:27.280">し</span><span begin="02:27.280" end="02:27.500">な</span><span begin="02:27.500" end="02:27.680">い</span><span begin="02:27.680" end="02:28.100">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不必在意被打湿 迈出微小的步伐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fumidashita ame mo ki ni shinaide</span></p><p begin="02:29.400" end="02:32.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">芽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:29.400" end="02:29.600">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吹</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:29.600" end="02:29.840">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="02:29.840" end="02:30.040">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.040" end="02:30.220">だ</span></span></span><span begin="02:30.220" end="02:30.500">す</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.600" end="02:30.820">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.820" end="02:31.200">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:31.200" end="02:31.460">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="02:31.460" end="02:31.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">草</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:31.840" end="02:32.000">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:32.000" end="02:32.260">さ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:32.260" end="02:32.440">ば</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:32.440" end="02:32.900">な</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让雨水萌发心中的花草</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mebukidasu kokoro no kusabana</span></p><p begin="02:34.180" end="02:36.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:34.180" end="02:34.400">か</span></span></span><span begin="02:34.400" end="02:34.640">け</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:34.640" end="02:34.760">よ</span></span></span><span begin="02:34.760" end="02:35.000">っ</span><span begin="02:35.000" end="02:35.380">た</span><span begin="02:35.380" end="02:35.620">ら</span><span begin="02:35.620" end="02:35.820">ぱ</span><span begin="02:35.820" end="02:35.999">っ</span><span begin="02:35.999" end="02:36.000">､</span><span begin="02:36.000" end="02:36.400">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">悄悄的屏息靠近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kakeyottara patto</span></p><p begin="02:36.560" end="02:38.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:36.560" end="02:36.780">だ</span></span></span><span begin="02:36.780" end="02:36.920">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">締</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:36.920" end="02:37.240">し</span></span></span><span begin="02:37.240" end="02:37.400">め</span><span begin="02:37.400" end="02:37.780">れ</span><span begin="02:37.780" end="02:38.000">ば</span><span begin="02:38.000" end="02:38.160">ぎ</span><span begin="02:38.160" end="02:38.240">ゅ</span><span begin="02:38.240" end="02:38.379">っ</span><span begin="02:38.379" end="02:38.380">､</span><span begin="02:38.380" end="02:38.800">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻轻的抱入怀中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakishimereba gyutto</span></p><p begin="02:38.860" end="02:44.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">凍</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:38.860" end="02:39.200">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:39.200" end="02:39.420">ご</span></span></span><span begin="02:39.420" end="02:39.600">え</span><span begin="02:39.600" end="02:39.760">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:39.760" end="02:39.980">て</span></span></span><span begin="02:39.980" end="02:40.140">の</span><span begin="02:40.140" end="02:40.400">ひ</span><span begin="02:40.400" end="02:40.680">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">熱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:40.820" end="02:41.020">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:41.020" end="02:41.220">つ</span></span></span><span begin="02:41.220" end="02:41.390">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">帯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:41.390" end="02:41.600">お</span></span></span><span begin="02:41.600" end="02:41.820">び</span><span begin="02:41.820" end="02:42.060">て</span><span begin="02:42.060" end="02:44.020">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就连冰冷的手心也逐渐的感到了热度</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kogoeta te no hira netsu o obiteku</span></p><p begin="02:48.860" end="02:59.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:48.860" end="02:49.260">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:49.260" end="02:50.200">い</span></span></span><span begin="02:50.200" end="02:50.720">さ</span><span begin="02:50.720" end="02:51.340">な</span><span begin="02:51.640" end="02:52.140">そ</span><span begin="02:52.140" end="02:53.020">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">指</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:53.020" end="02:53.300">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:53.300" end="02:53.540">び</span></span></span><span begin="02:53.540" end="02:54.000">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">重</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:54.440" end="02:54.820">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:54.820" end="02:55.740">さ</span></span></span><span begin="02:55.740" end="02:56.260">な</span><span begin="02:56.260" end="02:56.660">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:57.060" end="02:57.480">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:57.480" end="02:58.120">げ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:58.120" end="02:58.400">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:58.400" end="02:58.840">と</span></span></span><span begin="02:58.840" end="02:59.880">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">暗淡的残影与你那纤细的手指重合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisana sono yubi to kasanaru kage hitotsu</span></p><p begin="03:00.339" end="03:04.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="03:00.339" end="03:00.540">｢ど</span><span begin="03:00.540" end="03:00.760">う</span><span begin="03:00.760" end="03:00.960">か</span><span begin="03:00.960" end="03:01.200">し</span><span begin="03:01.200" end="03:01.440">た</span><span begin="03:01.440" end="03:01.882">の｣</span><span begin="03:01.882" end="03:02.294">って</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:02.500" end="03:02.720">み</span></span></span><span begin="03:02.720" end="03:03.420">つ</span><span begin="03:03.420" end="03:03.680">め</span><span begin="03:03.680" end="03:03.940">て</span><span begin="03:03.940" end="03:04.140">る</span><span begin="03:04.140" end="03:04.580" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="あ|な|た" ttx:rubyTimes="03:04.140,03:04.360 03:04.360,03:04.580 03:04.580,03:04.940">貴</span><span begin="03:04.580" end="03:04.940" ttx:rubyGroup="1">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">「怎么了？」你静静的看着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dōka shita no tte mitsumeteru anata</span></p><p begin="03:05.160" end="03:15.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="03:05.160" end="03:05.400">こ</span><span begin="03:05.400" end="03:05.800">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">温</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:05.800" end="03:06.280">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:06.280" end="03:06.640">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:06.640" end="03:07.320">ど</span></span></span><span begin="03:07.320" end="03:07.560">も</span><span begin="03:07.560" end="03:07.980">い</span><span begin="03:07.980" end="03:09.200">つ</span><span begin="03:09.200" end="03:09.780">か</span><span begin="03:10.000" end="03:10.240">た</span><span begin="03:10.240" end="03:10.440">だ</span><span begin="03:10.440" end="03:11.660">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:12.200" end="03:12.440">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">録</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:12.440" end="03:12.640">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:12.640" end="03:12.860">く</span></span></span><span begin="03:12.860" end="03:15.500">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份温暖也终将成为仅仅的记录吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono ondo mo itsuka tada no kiroku ni</span></p><p begin="03:33.460" end="03:41.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:33.460" end="03:33.900">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:33.900" end="03:34.320">み</span></span></span><span begin="03:34.320" end="03:34.900">の</span><span begin="03:36.260" end="03:37.080">い</span><span begin="03:37.080" end="03:37.325">つ</span><span begin="03:37.325" end="03:37.540">も</span><span begin="03:37.540" end="03:37.900">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:37.900" end="03:38.320">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:38.320" end="03:38.700">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:38.700" end="03:39.160">お</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:39.440" end="03:39.720">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:39.720" end="03:39.960">ぼ</span></span></span><span begin="03:39.960" end="03:40.320">え</span><span begin="03:40.320" end="03:40.720">て</span><span begin="03:40.720" end="03:41.080">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你那一如既往的笑容 我仍依稀记得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no itsumo no egao oboeteru</span></p><p begin="03:41.080" end="03:45.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:41.080" end="03:41.760">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:41.760" end="03:41.940">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:41.940" end="03:42.240">ど</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">四</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:42.240" end="03:42.720">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">季</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:42.720" end="03:43.140">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">巡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:43.140" end="03:43.500">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:43.500" end="03:44.090">ぐ</span></span></span><span begin="03:44.090" end="03:44.500">っ</span><span begin="03:44.500" end="03:44.740">て</span><span begin="03:44.740" end="03:45.420">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论四季如何更迭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nando shiki meguttemo</span></p><p begin="03:45.840" end="03:53.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">膨</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:45.840" end="03:46.663">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:46.663" end="03:46.860">く</span></span></span><span begin="03:46.860" end="03:47.080">ら</span><span begin="03:47.080" end="03:47.460">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:47.460" end="03:47.860">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:47.860" end="03:48.260">も</span></span></span><span begin="03:48.260" end="03:48.680">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:48.680" end="03:49.260">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:49.260" end="03:49.540">だ</span></span></span><span begin="03:49.540" end="03:50.040">き</span><span begin="03:50.320" end="03:50.740" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="あ|し|た" ttx:rubyTimes="03:50.320,03:50.740 03:50.740,03:51.100 03:51.100,03:51.520">明</span><span begin="03:50.740" end="03:51.520" ttx:rubyGroup="1">日</span><span begin="03:51.520" end="03:51.900">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:51.900" end="03:52.700">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:52.700" end="03:53.120">づ</span></span></span><span begin="03:53.120" end="03:53.920">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我都会带着和煦的回忆走向明日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fukuramu omoide daki ashita e tsuzuku</span></p><p begin="03:54.320" end="04:00.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">未</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.320" end="03:54.760">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.760" end="03:55.160">ら</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:55.160" end="03:55.580">い</span></span></span><span begin="03:55.580" end="03:55.960">の</span><span begin="03:56.180" end="03:56.403" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="album" ttx:rubyTimes="03:56.180,03:57.100">ア</span><span begin="03:56.403" end="03:56.606" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ル</span><span begin="03:56.606" end="03:56.820" ttx:rubyGroup="1">バ</span><span begin="03:56.820" end="03:57.100" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ム</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:57.620" end="03:57.880">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:57.880" end="03:58.080">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:58.080" end="03:58.500">ど</span></span></span><span begin="03:58.660" end="03:58.880">で</span><span begin="03:58.880" end="03:59.100">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:59.100" end="03:59.320">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:59.320" end="03:59.680">る</span></span></span><span begin="03:59.680" end="04:00.080">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">未来的相册将会成为永恒的留念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mirai no arubamu nando demo shirushi</span></p><p begin="04:00.280" end="04:05.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">百</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:00.280" end="04:00.500">ひゃ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:00.500" end="04:01.360">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">年</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:01.360" end="04:01.760">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:01.760" end="04:02.280">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:02.280" end="04:02.520">ご</span></span></span><span begin="04:02.520" end="04:02.960">も</span><span begin="04:03.360" end="04:04.200" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="ふ|た|り" ttx:rubyTimes="04:03.360,04:03.760 04:03.760,04:04.200 04:04.200,04:05.100">二</span><span begin="04:04.200" end="04:05.100" ttx:rubyGroup="1">人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就算经历百年我也会陪伴你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hyakunen go mo futari</span></p><p begin="04:05.400" end="04:14.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:05.400" end="04:05.800">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:05.800" end="04:06.420">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:06.420" end="04:06.660">ど</span></span></span><span begin="04:06.660" end="04:07.120">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:07.380" end="04:07.620">み</span></span></span><span begin="04:07.620" end="04:07.800">つ</span><span begin="04:07.800" end="04:08.220">け</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:08.220" end="04:08.740">だ</span></span></span><span begin="04:08.740" end="04:09.040">す</span><span begin="04:09.040" end="04:09.501">よ『</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:09.820" end="04:10.240">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:10.240" end="04:10.580">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:10.580" end="04:11.019">し</span></span></span><span begin="04:11.019" end="04:11.440">』の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:11.440" end="04:12.226">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:12.226" end="04:12.641">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:12.641" end="04:14.160">ろ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所以不论何时都要回想起来啊 关于『我』的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nando mo mitsukedasu yo watashi no kokoro</span></p><p begin="04:14.640" end="04:25.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:14.640" end="04:15.064">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:15.064" end="04:15.460">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:15.460" end="04:15.840">ら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">物</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:15.840" end="04:16.280">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:16.280" end="04:16.820">の</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:17.060" end="04:17.496">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:17.496" end="04:18.400">と</span></span></span><span begin="04:18.400" end="04:19.171">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">次</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:19.540" end="04:20.020">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:20.020" end="04:20.420">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="04:20.420" end="04:21.031">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">『私』</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:21.031" end="04:21.031">『</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:21.031" end="04:21.280">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:21.280" end="04:22.140">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:22.140" end="04:22.679">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:22.679" end="04:22.680">』</span></span></span><span begin="04:22.680" end="04:25.580">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如今留下这份宝物 献给下一个『我』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">takaramono hitotsu tsugi no watashi e</span></p></div></body></tt>